 "notes": [
  "**Streaming Sortformer v2 每段真實會議都最好，而且不用告訴它人數**：4 人會議 5 分鐘 4.5%、整場 26 分鐘 9.6%，2 人會議 0.5%、0.7%；授權 CC BY 4.0 可商用，在 Mac 的 GPU 上 30 分鐘會議約 1 分鐘。限制是最多 4 人。平台現用的 sherpa-onnx 不給人數時會切出太多人（整場 26 分鐘切成 66 人），給了人數也不穩（R8009 5 分鐘 40.7%、R8001 整場 29.9%）；Azure 人數都猜對，錯誤多半是講者重疊時漏掉。",
  "**Streaming Sortformer v2 is best on every real meeting, without being told the speaker count**: 4.5% on 5 min and 9.6% on the whole 26 min of the 4-speaker meeting, 0.5% and 0.7% on the 2-speaker one; CC BY 4.0, about 1 min for a 30 min meeting on the Mac's GPU; at most 4 speakers. The platform's sherpa-onnx finds far too many speakers when not told (66 in 26 min) and is uneven even when told (40.7% on R8009 5 min, 29.9% on all of R8001); Azure always finds the right count and mostly misses overlapping speech."
 ]
}
